struct Profile {
    uint256 nonce;
    string name;
    Metadata metadata;
    address owner;
    address anchor;
}
Field	Data Type	Notes	nonce	uint256	A unique uint (any value not already used)	name	string	The profile name.	metadata	Metadata	See the metadata section below for more details.	owner	address	The wallet address of the profile owner.	anchor	address	The unique id assigned to the profile when it is created.

